      "id": "Task-07",
      "prompt": "Build a standalone two-vehicle MOOS-IvP mission for `alpha` and `bravo`, including an IvP behavior named `BHV_ContactIntercept`. Alpha should patrol a 210 meter triangular route while Bravo uses the behavior to guide toward a predicted intercept point ahead of Alpha. The vehicles should use collision avoidance."
    },
